{{name}} connects the SEOCart store plugin to {{label}}.

== Description ==

{{name}} is a free extension of SEOCart, the free, open-source store plugin for WordPress. It needs SEOCart, installed and active.

Version 0.1.0 is the extension's starting point and does not do anything yet.

== Installation ==

1. Install and activate SEOCart.
2. In your site's dashboard, go to **Store > Extensions**, find {{name}} and select **Install**, then **Activate**.
3. Or install it from WordPress.org: go to **Plugins > Add Plugin**, search for "{{name}}", then select **Install Now** and **Activate**.

== External services ==

{{name}} 0.1.0 does not connect to any external service. This section will list every server the extension contacts, written from the hosts the extension declares to SEOCart.

== Source code and build steps ==

The complete, human-readable source code of this plugin is public at https://github.com/cirkuitnet/{{slug}}. It is built with SEOCart's tools, from a SEOCart checkout beside it: `php ../seocart/bin/build-zip.php --plugin=.` assembles the installable zip in `dist/`.

